# Rendered reference pixels are regenerable and large (24 MB for three 1920x1080 RGBA TIFFs).
# The committed artefact is `manifest.json`, which carries each frame's pixelSha256 — the digest
# the comparison actually uses — plus the project digest, AE build and pinned templates needed to
# reproduce the frames with `export-references.sh`. Committing the pixels would add tens of
# megabytes per fixture while proving nothing the manifest does not already pin.
*/frames/
